-decimal.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"decimal\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> score</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">Oswestry disability index score ODI</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">0..1</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-decimal\">decimal</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/></tr>\r\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"opt-item.odi-1\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-1 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I have no pain at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;The pain is very mild at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;The pain is moderate at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;The pain is fairly severe at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;The pain is very severe at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;The pain is the worst imaginable at the moment.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-2\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-2 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can look after myself normally without causing extra pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can look after myself normally but it is very painful.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;It is painful to look after myself and I am slow and careful.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I need some help but can manage most of my personal care.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I need help every day in most aspects of my personal care.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I do not get dressed, I wash with difficulty and stay in bed.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-3\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-3 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can lift heavy weights without additional pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can lift heavy weights but it gives additional pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me lifting heavy weights off the floor, but I can manage if they are conveniently placed e.g. on a table.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from lifting heavy weights, but I can manage light to medium weights if they are conveniently positioned.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can lift very light weights.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I cannot lift or carry anything at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-4\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-4 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain does not prevent me walking any distance.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from walking more than one mile.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from walking more than a quarter of a mile.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from walking more than 100 yards.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can only walk using a stick or crutches.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I am in bed most of the time and have to crawl to the toilet.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-5\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-5 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can sit in any chair as long as I like.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can only sit in my favorite chair as long as I like.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from sitting for more than one hour.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from sitting for more than half an hour.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from sitting for more than 10 minutes.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from sitting at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-6\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-6 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can stand as long as I want without additional pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can stand as long as I want but it gives me additional pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from standing for more than 1 hour.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from standing for more than half an hour.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from standing for more than 10 minutes.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from standing at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-7\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-7 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My sleep is never interrupted by pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My sleep is occasionally interrupted by pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Because of pain I have less than 6 hours sleep.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Because of pain I have less than 4 hours sleep.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Because of pain I have less than 2 hours sleep.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from sleeping at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-8\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-8 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My sex life is normal and causes no additional pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My sex life is normal but causes some additional pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My sex life is nearly normal but is very painful.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My sex life is severely restricted by pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My sex life is non existent because of pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents me from having any sex life at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-9\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-9 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My social life is normal and causes me no additional pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;My social life is normal but increases the degree of pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain has no significant effect on social life apart from limiting my more energetic interests e.g. sports, etc.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain has restricted my social life and I do not go out as often.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain has restricted social life to my home.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I have no social life because of pain.&quot;)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.odi-10\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for odi-10 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can travel anywhere without pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;I can travel anywhere but it gives me additional pain.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain is bad but I am able to manage trips over two hours.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain restricts me to trips of less than one hour.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain restricts trips to short necessary journeys under 30 minutes.&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#null (&quot;Pain prevents traveling except to receive treatment.&quot;)</li></ul></div>"
